== H. Corollary 8.1 exponents (sympy) ==
  4a - theta + beta = 0 ;  (1-theta H)/2 - beta = 0
  -beta - (4a - 1/2) = (H - 16*alpha)/(2*(H + 2))
  H=1: 4a - theta = 4*alpha/3 - 1/3 ; (1-4a)/3 <= 1/2-4a iff a <= [1/16]
  H=1: beta>0 iff alpha < 1/8; at alpha=3/16 beta = -0.25
  depth 3 (H=2), alpha=1/16: beta = 1/8
  L=3: L/(2H(2L-1)) = 3/20  1/(4H) = 1/8
  8x^4 - 4 - (x^2+1)^2 = (x - 1)*(x + 1)*(7*x**2 + 5)

